nt sets of downstream effectors directly responsible for vesicle formation, movement, tethering and fusion (By similarity). As part of the ECS(RAB40A) complex, mediates RHOU 'Lys-48'-linked ubiquitination and degradation, thus inhibiting focal adhesion disassembly during cell migration (PubMed:26598620)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}